OL,3,AAs Christmas rush looms, how do
OL,4,AChina-made toys find their way to the
OL,5,AUS?
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn the underside of most children's
OL,8,Ftoys on sale in the US you'll find the
OL,9,Fsame three words ` "Made in China".
OL,11,FNearly eight in 10 toys (78.3%)
OL,12,Fimported into the country in 2024 came
OL,13,Ffrom China, according to US government
OL,14,Ffigures.
OL,16,FLast year, toys imported from China
OL,17,Fwere worth $9.8bn (#7.4bn), trade
OL,18,Ffigures show.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
